{
  "version": "4.0.0",
  "language": "zh-Hans",
  "language_raw": "Simp_Chinese",
  "source": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_side02_0010.dat",
  "paired_tbl": "message/dat/Simp_Chinese/script/s1_side02_0010.tbl",
  "matching": "TRAILING_MAX_SENTINEL",
  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_01",
      "hash64": "7E330278B0576121",
      "text": "哦，是同学你啊！\\n难道……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_02",
      "hash64": "7E32FF78B0575C08",
      "text": "你在北上乡捕捉到１５０种以上的\\n宝可梦了啊！挺厉害嘛～！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 28,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_select_01",
      "hash64": "EFEB4D443AB14FA8",
      "text": "没错，我很厉害哦！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_select_02",
      "hash64": "EFEB50443AB154C1",
      "text": "你过奖了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_03",
      "hash64": "7E330078B0575DBB",
      "text": "真厉害，真厉害！\\n很能干嘛，年轻人～！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_04",
      "hash64": "7E330578B057663A",
      "text": "啊哈哈！\\n你要自信点哦，年轻人～！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_05",
      "hash64": "7E330678B05767ED",
      "text": "感觉你比更早来到这里的我\\n都更了解北上的宝可梦了！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 25,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_06",
      "hash64": "7E330378B05762D4",
      "text": "……对了！同学！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 8,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_07",
      "hash64": "7E330478B0576487",
      "text": "我有事想拜托你这位\\n捕捉宝可梦的高手！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_select_03",
      "hash64": "EFEB4F443AB1530E",
      "text": "有事想拜托？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_select_04",
      "hash64": "EFEB52443AB15827",
      "text": "我没兴趣……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_08",
      "hash64": "7E32F978B05751D6",
      "text": "很好！我很欣赏\\n你那充满好奇心的精神！\\r\\n那么～就让我来说明一下吧。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 36,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_09",
      "hash64": "7E32FA78B0575389",
      "text": "同学！偶尔绕绕路\\n也是很重要的哦！\\r\\n……那么我要说明咯。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 17,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 31,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_10",
      "hash64": "7E368778B05A78F7",
      "text": "我之所以会来北上，\\n是因为想找出某只宝可梦……\\r\\n并拍下它的照片。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 23,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 35,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_11",
      "hash64": "7E368678B05A7744",
      "text": "我一直在独自一人寻找它，\\n但完～全找不到！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 21,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_12",
      "hash64": "7E368978B05A7C5D",
      "text": "……所以！如果同学你\\n能和我一起找它，\\r\\n我会十分感激的……[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 19,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 32,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_13",
      "hash64": "7E368878B05A7AAA",
      "text": "而且我还听说，\\n我在寻找的宝可梦相当强。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 20,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_14",
      "hash64": "7E368378B05A722B",
      "text": "如果你能捉住它，它可能会\\n成为你旅途中可靠的伙伴哦。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 26,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_15",
      "hash64": "7E368278B05A7078",
      "text": "如果你有兴趣一起找，\\n就让我见识一下你有多强吧！[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s1_side02_0010_camera_16",
      "hash64": "7E368578B05A7591",
      "text": "毕竟是要成为我的搭档，\\n我想先了解一下你的实力。\\r\\n而且我还想拍下你的英姿。[VAR 0x0114(0046)]",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 24,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 40,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0114",
          "args_hex": [
            "0046"
          ]
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
